<!-- SECTION 7: 7-STEP PROCESS -->
<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How Trademark Hearing Works for Pune Applicants</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Hearings at TM Registry Mumbai (Maharashtra jurisdiction). Virtual via video conference since 2020. Appeals to Bombay HC Pune Bench. Patron handles all from Wagholi.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Review Hearing Notice and Application Status</h3><p class="step-description">When a Pune applicant's status shows 'Ready for Show Cause Hearing' on IP India portal, the Examiner has issued a show cause hearing notice. Patron reviews the notice: hearing date, time, jurisdiction (TM Registry Mumbai), and specific unresolved objections. Applicant has 1 month from receipt to prepare.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Notice Reviewed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Objections Identified</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="5" width="100" height="85" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Hearing Notice</text><line x1="20" y1="30" x2="100" y2="30" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="25" y="44" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Application No.</text><text x="25" y="56" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Hearing Date</text><text x="25" y="68" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">TM Registry Mumbai</text><path d="M92 42l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M92 54l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M92 66l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Notice Analysed</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Analyse Examination Report Objections</h3><p class="step-description">Patron analyses the original examination report in detail: Section 9 cited (lack of distinctiveness, descriptiveness, genericness) or Section 11 (similarity with earlier marks), which sub-sections apply, earlier conflicting marks cited, and what the original written reply addressed or missed. Related: <a href="#">Trademark Objection Reply</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>S.9 / S.11 Mapped</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Gaps Identified</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="75" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="75" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="34" y="25" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Section 9</text><text x="86" y="25" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Section 11</text><text x="34" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Absolute</text><text x="86" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Relative</text><text x="34" y="58" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Descriptive</text><text x="86" y="58" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Similar Mark</text><text x="34" y="70" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Generic</text><text x="86" y="70" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Same Class</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Strategy Set</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Prepare Case Law, Evidence, and Written Submissions</h3><p class="step-description">Patron compiles: relevant case law and Registrar precedents, usage evidence (invoices, advertising, website, social media, GST returns, sales data), affidavit of usage, consent/coexistence letters from cited prior mark owners (if obtainable). Written submissions structured to address each objection point-by-point.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Case Law Compiled</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Evidence Packaged</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Case Preparation</text><rect x="25" y="38" width="70" height="10" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="46" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Case Law + Precedents</text><rect x="25" y="54" width="70" height="10" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Usage Evidence Compiled</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Submission Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Attend the Hearing (Physical or Virtual)</h3><p class="step-description">Patron's trademark representative attends the show cause hearing at TM Registry Mumbai - physical or virtual (video conference since 2020). For virtual: stable internet, working audio/video, screen-sharing tested. Oral arguments presented, Hearing Officer's questions answered, additional documents submitted if requested.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Hearing Attended</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Arguments Presented</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="35" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="30" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Hearing Day</text><rect x="20" y="55" width="38" height="25" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1"/><text x="39" y="70" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Physical</text><rect x="62" y="55" width="38" height="25" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="81" y="70" font-size="5" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Virtual</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Hearing Complete</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Receive the Registrar's Order</h3><p class="step-description">Hearing Officer issues order: accepted (proceeds to TM Journal for 4-month opposition), accepted with conditions/amendments/limitations, or refused (appealable to Bombay HC Pune Bench). Order typically within 2-8 weeks. Patron monitors and communicates outcome immediately.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Order Received</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Outcome Communicated</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.15"/><rect x="43" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><rect x="81" y="15" width="34" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#E53E3E" stroke-width="1"/><text x="22" y="38" font-size="6" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Accept</text><text x="60" y="38" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Cond.</text><text x="98" y="38" font-size="6" fill="#E53E3E" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Refuse</text><text x="22" y="55" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">TM Journal</text><text x="60" y="55" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Modified</text><text x="98" y="55" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Appeal HC</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Decision Made</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Post-Hearing Action</h3><p class="step-description">If accepted: Patron monitors TM Journal publication and 4-month opposition period. If no opposition, registration certificate issued. If opposition filed, Patron handles the proceeding. If refused: appeal merits evaluated for Bombay HC (Pune Bench). Related: <a href="/trademark-registration">Trademark Registration</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Journal Monitored</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Opposition Managed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="43" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="81" y="15" width="34" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="22" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Journal</text><text x="60" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">4-Month</text><text x="98" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Cert</text><text x="22" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Published</text><text x="60" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Opposition</text><text x="98" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Issued</text></svg></div><span class="